<figure class="guide-figure" aria-label="One LSU account across web, native and embedded app screens">
<dl class="guide-accounts">
<div><dt>Web app</dt><dd><strong>Your LSU email and password</strong><span>Your training, messages and workspaces, with permissions checked by LSU.</span><a href="/getting-started">Sign into the web app</a></dd></div>
<div><dt>Native apps</dt><dd><strong>The same account, a session on each device</strong><span>Shared training records with native controls, recording and supported device services.</span><a href="/onboarding">Complete app onboarding</a></dd></div>
<div><dt>Web component</dt><dd><strong>The LSU app inside a host page</strong><span>Authentication stays in the application. The host does not receive your password or session token.</span><a href="/integration">Understand the integration</a></dd></div>
</dl>
<figcaption>The account is shared. Each device and embedded browser context still needs its own valid session.</figcaption>
</figure>
